{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rehydrate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The live store to reconcile."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only. Pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemoteAdditive"},{"type":"text","text":" after a container rebuild,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where a row’s absence says nothing about whether it was deleted."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"policy"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Takes the store rather than "},{"code":"inout State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on purpose. Re-hydration is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mid-session operation with two "},{"code":"await","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s in it (the flush, then the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fetches), and any caller holding a state snapshot across those would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overwrite everything dispatched in between. Here the flush and every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fetch complete first; only then does one suspension-free step pack a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fresh snapshot, merge, and unpack."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under the default "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote"},{"type":"text","text":", remote edits and remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deletions surface mid-session. An ID is exempt whenever the local side"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still has something to say about it — a drained-but-unflushed write, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"un-drained edit, a pending deletion, or a write whose save failed. Those"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always win, and that guarantee is not configurable."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pending writes and deletions are flushed to disk "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the merge, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remote-change refresh that fires during the debounce window can’t read a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stale disk row for an entity the user just edited or deleted and resurrect"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it. The flush closes most of the window; the dirty set closes what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remaining suspension points let through."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One case can’t be inferred — an edit still sitting in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view’s local ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has never reached the store, so a remote value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can land underneath it. Bindings made with ","type":"text"},{"code":"store.binding(_:sending:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dispatch on write and are covered already. Otherwise declare the edit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","type":"reference"},{"text":" (see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds","type":"reference"},{"text":"), which exempts one ID for as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"long as it is being edited, or register a whole collection with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"style":"important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a fetch fails, the corresponding "},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is left untouched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the failure is reported via "},{"code":"onFailure","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"role":"symbol","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]},"title":"rehydrate(into:policy:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE9rehydrate4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Re-hydration that reconciles stored rows into the live "},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without dropping unflushed writes or in-progress edits (rule #8).","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinato